<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60167" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κροτών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tick, Ixodes ricinus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				552a15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agatharch.
				58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.55e
			</span></i>: prov., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγιέστερος κροτῶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					318
				</span></i>
			 (but <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.1.12
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρότωνος</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>castor-oil tree, Ricinus communis</i> (cf.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίκι</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.201
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.10.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.18.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				39.3
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pl., <i>seeds</i> of the tree, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				499.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; in full, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κίκεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.743
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>part of the ear</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.85
			</span></i>. (<i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
			</span></i> Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.36
			</span></i> distinguishes <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κροτών</span> from
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρότων</span> the
		place-name.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
